WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.209 --> 00:00:04.171
(Texting dings)

00:00:07.716 --> 00:00:11.094
I was just wondering if you
wanted to um, you know, go out
sometime?

00:00:11.094 --> 00:00:11.970
Do you want to get a coffee?

00:00:12.221 --> 00:00:13.222
Now?

00:00:13.222 --> 00:00:14.223
Yes, now!

00:00:17.559 --> 00:00:18.352
I’ll just hang on.

00:00:19.436 --> 00:00:22.856
♪When I wake up,
Well I know I'm gonna be♪

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:24.066
Cole:
Her name is Sadie.

00:00:24.066 --> 00:00:25.609
♪I'm gonna be the man who wakes
up next to you♪

00:00:25.609 --> 00:00:27.236
Cole:
I mean I know this sounds
crazy,

00:00:27.236 --> 00:00:28.612
Cole:
but I think she might be
the one!

00:00:28.612 --> 00:00:32.950
♪I know I'm gonna be,
I'm gonna be the man who goes
along with you♪

00:00:32.950 --> 00:00:35.327
She really is great. You’ll see.

00:00:38.872 --> 00:00:39.581
Man:
Any word?

00:00:40.207 --> 00:00:41.041
She ghosted him.

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:43.001
I bet she isn’t even seeing your
texts.

00:00:43.001 --> 00:00:44.461
She does travel a lot for work.

00:00:44.461 --> 00:00:45.712
Go to her.

00:00:45.754 --> 00:00:46.964
I’m going to London.

00:00:46.964 --> 00:00:48.465
♪♪

00:00:48.465 --> 00:00:52.052
♪But I would walk 500 miles♪

00:00:52.052 --> 00:00:54.554
See, you get it. It’s a grand,
romantic gesture!

00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:59.476
Yea, that’s amazing, mate! Five
thousand miles to surprise a
girl you’ve only met once.

00:00:59.476 --> 00:01:01.770
Especially if she’s the one
who ghosted ya.

00:01:03.897 --> 00:01:07.109
No, no. She didn’t ghost me. She
just doesn’t have an
international calling plan.

00:01:07.109 --> 00:01:08.694
Oh, right.

00:01:08.694 --> 00:01:14.199
♪♪

00:01:16.076 --> 00:01:16.743
Where am I?

00:01:17.869 --> 00:01:20.872
Oh, God. You have the wrong guy!
I’m a farmer. Wait, wait!

00:01:21.331 --> 00:01:22.916
(Panics)

00:01:28.797 --> 00:01:30.257
Can you walk, Cole?

00:01:31.591 --> 00:01:32.509
Sadie!

00:01:39.599 --> 00:01:40.642
Who are you?

00:01:40.642 --> 00:01:41.351
C.I.A.

00:01:43.061 --> 00:01:45.731
I’m so confused. They kept
asking me about the tax man.

00:01:45.731 --> 00:01:46.940
They asked you about the tax
man?

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:48.775
They think I am a tax man.

00:01:50.902 --> 00:01:51.903
You’re the tax man?

00:01:51.903 --> 00:01:52.821
Oh, my God.

00:01:52.821 --> 00:01:54.072
Oh, my God!

00:01:54.072 --> 00:01:56.158
♪♪

00:01:58.243 --> 00:02:01.079
You got me kidnapped
and tortured all after one date!

00:02:03.165 --> 00:02:04.249
I swallowed a rock!

00:02:05.417 --> 00:02:07.002
You’re the one who flew to
London!

00:02:08.628 --> 00:02:10.380
It was a romantic gesture!

00:02:12.424 --> 00:02:16.136
♪♪

00:02:18.430 --> 00:02:20.474
Leveque:
Get every bounty hunter
on the continent.

00:02:20.974 --> 00:02:22.893
I want her alive!

00:02:22.893 --> 00:02:24.853
♪♪

00:02:24.853 --> 00:02:26.563
This is bigger than you and me.

00:02:31.318 --> 00:02:33.653
Monte:
Didn’t it ever occur to you that
he could be a foreign asset

00:02:33.653 --> 00:02:35.030
trying to compromise your
mission? 

00:02:40.410 --> 00:02:41.411
Who the hell are you?

00:02:46.958 --> 00:02:48.001
I’m the boyfriend.

00:02:54.257 --> 00:02:55.217
Do you trust me?

00:02:55.217 --> 00:02:56.259
Is that a joke?

